    "body": "Merged main into this branch (a maintainer-side merge, allowed by the PR's \"allow edits by maintainers\"); head 51b056a7 -> 3f6d3216. Conflicts: `crates/app/src/posting.rs` and `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs` (main added the TinyG post; kept both sides), and `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/grblhal/contour_disc_hole.nc` and `contour_tangential_lead.nc` (main regenerated them for the arc-fit change in c9822758; took main's, this PR does not change them). `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the AltMill files. Tests: conformance 6/6, altmill_machines 4/4, machine 33/33; clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings clean. Awaiting a review of this head; it is still a draft - flag it ready when you want it reviewed.",
