    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 6a4309385b2ac4d1863989628916e429bac96ecf -->\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.** The one blocker from the earlier review (#733 review at 3f6d3216) is fixed.\n\nWhat I checked on the new head 6a430938:\n- `git diff 3f6d3216 6a430938` is a merge of main (8b7975a1, whose remerge-diff is empty) plus one commit that changes only `crates/app/tests/altmill_machines.rs`. No golden, snapshot, machine file or non-test source was changed by hand.\n- The inch case in `the_4x4_two_tool_program_is_locked` now posts through the document path (`engine::run_with` with options `{\"Units\": \"inch\"}`, #902) on the unmodified shipped 4x4 machine file. It still asserts byte equality against the unchanged `altmill_4x4_two_tool_inch.nc`, and still asserts no warnings. Not weakened or skipped.\n- Head already contains current main (440a6b8d), so the local build is the PR head as is. PROCESS_VERSION on main is 50; the PR touches no process files.\n\nLocal results (Windows, debug):\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `altmill_machines` | 4 passed |\n| `machine` | 33 passed |\n| `machine_library` | 11 passed |\n| `grblhal_post` | 9 passed |\n| `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` | clean |\n\nEverything else in the earlier review stands. Body ends `Fixes #728` (issue is `effort:medium`, `P6`).\n\nNot exercised: the UI crate and the full batch tier (the diff touches no UI code).\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
